OL,3,CBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,4,Ccelebrations kick off
OL,6,FBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,7,Fcelebrations have kicked-off.
OL,9,FThe event first brought people
OL,10,Ftogether through culture to celebrate
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's growing diversity
OL,12,Ftwenty years ago.
OL,14,FA special anniversary programme for
OL,15,Fthe 2026 celebration later in August
OL,16,Fwas launched on Thursday.
OL,18,FThe festival runs from August 22-30
OL,19,Fand begins with the Mela Carnival.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/5
