OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786195093
OL,3,CBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,4,Ccelebrations kick off
OL,6,FThe world premiere of Earth Child
OL,7,Ftakes place at the Titanic Slipways
OL,8,Fand an expanded Mela+ programme runs
OL,9,Fthroughout the week.
OL,11,FMela Day returns to Botanic Gardens at
OL,12,Fthe end of the week with five stages,
OL,13,Fglobal street food, family activities
OL,14,Fand performances from around the world.
OL,16,FSince its beginnings in 2006, Belfast
OL,17,FMela has grown from a small community
OL,18,Fgathering into one of Northern
OL,19,FIreland's best-loved festivals and a
OL,20,Fcornerstone of Belfast's cultural
OL,21,Fcalendar.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/5
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
