OL,3,CBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,4,Ccelebrations kick off
OL,6,FOver the past 20 years, it has
OL,7,Fwelcomed hundreds of thousands of
OL,8,Fvisitors and showcased artists from
OL,9,Facross the island of Ireland and
OL,10,Faround the world, introducing
OL,11,Faudiences to new cultures, traditions
OL,12,Fand experiences.
OL,14,FFounder of Belfast Mela and CEO of
OL,15,FArtsEkta, Nisha Tandon said: "Reaching
OL,16,Four 20th anniversary is an incredibly
OL,17,Fproud moment for everyone who has been
OL,18,Fpart of Belfast Mela's journey.
OL,26,@wD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/5
