PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786195093
OL,3,CBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,4,Ccelebrations kick off
OL,6,F"What makes this festival so special
OL,7,Fisn't just its scale, but its ability
OL,8,Fto bring people together through
OL,9,Fshared experiences, creating spaces
OL,10,Fwhere different cultures are
OL,11,Fcelebrated, new friendships are
OL,12,Fformed, and everyone feels they
OL,13,Fbelong."
OL,15,F"This year's programme reflects
OL,16,Feverything Mela stands for - it's
OL,17,Fbold, joyful and ambitious, while
OL,18,Fstaying true to the values that
OL,19,Finspired us from the very beginning,"
OL,20,Fshe said.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
