OL,3,CBelfast Mela's 20th anniversary
OL,4,Ccelebrations kick off
OL,6,F"As we celebrate this milestone, we're
OL,7,Falso looking ahead with excitement to
OL,8,Fthe next chapter, continuing to build
OL,9,Fconnections, champion creativity and
OL,10,Fshowcase Belfast as a confident,
OL,11,Fwelcoming and internationally
OL,12,Fconnected city."
